1
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,160
I'm Peppa Pig.

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,279
[OINKS]

3
00:00:05,279 --> 00:00:08,039
This is my little brother
George.

4
00:00:08,039 --> 00:00:10,559
This is mummy Pig.

5
00:00:10,559 --> 00:00:11,959
And this is daddy Pig.

6
00:00:11,959 --> 00:00:13,360
[OINKS]
[LAUGHTER]

7
00:00:14,559 --> 00:00:15,959
Peppa Pig. Oink.

8
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,640
[PEPPA READS
ONSCREEN TEXT]

9
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:27,360
NARRATOR:
Mummy and Daddy Pig
have just made breakfast

10
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,480
for Peppa and George.

11
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:31,080
Oink! Breakfast is ready!

12
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:33,120
[GEORGE OINKS,
THEN LAUGHS]

13
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:36,199
Oink!
Oink!

14
00:00:36,199 --> 00:00:38,680
Peppa has red spots
on her face!

15
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:42,720
Mummy, I don't feel
very well. Oink!

16
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:44,080
Oh dear, Peppa.

17
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:45,720
You don't look very well.

18
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
Oink! Don't worry.

19
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,960
I'll ring Doctor Brown-Bear.

20
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,120
Doctor Brown-Bear speaking.

21
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:56,080
Oink!
Peppa is not very well.

22
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:58,640
Her face is covered
in red spots!

23
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:03,599
Hmm. Put Peppa to bed
and I'll come straight round.

24
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:08,640
Doctor Brown-Bear
has come to make Peppa better.

25
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:11,759
Hello Peppa,
how are you today?

26
00:01:11,759 --> 00:01:13,320
I am not very well.

27
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:16,200
Stick your tongue out,
please.

28
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:19,479
Hmm. It's not
anything serious.

29
00:01:19,479 --> 00:01:21,560
Peppa has just got a rash.

30
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,360
Oink!
Do I need medicine?

31
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:25,119
The rash will
clear up quickly.

32
00:01:25,119 --> 00:01:29,000
But if you like, I can give
you just a little medicine.

33
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,160
Yes, please.

34
00:01:31,160 --> 00:01:33,920
I'm afraid it doesn't
taste very nice.

35
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:35,640
Open wide please.

36
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:39,679
Yuck! Disgusting!

37
00:01:39,679 --> 00:01:45,000
You are a brave little one
for taking it so well.

38
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,399
Peppa must stay in bed.

39
00:01:46,399 --> 00:01:49,520
I'll call back later
to check that she is better.

40
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:51,199
Oink!
Can Peppa have visitors?

41
00:01:51,199 --> 00:01:53,880
Oh yes,
she can have visitors.

42
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:56,160
The rash isn't catching.

43
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,280
Goodbye!

44
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:59,559
Oink!
Goodbye Doctor Brown-Bear!

45
00:01:59,559 --> 00:02:01,880
Mummy, can I get up now?

46
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:03,399
Doctor Brown-Bear
says that you must

47
00:02:03,399 --> 00:02:05,240
stay in bed for
a little bit Peppa.

48
00:02:05,240 --> 00:02:08,160
[SIGHING]
But it's so boring!

49
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:10,639
Doctor Brown-Bear did say
you could have visitors.

50
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:13,079
Oink!
Can Suzy Sheep visit me?

51
00:02:13,079 --> 00:02:16,040
Suzy Sheep
is Peppa's best friend.

52
00:02:16,040 --> 00:02:18,239
I'll ring Suzy Sheep's mummy.

53
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:23,480
Bleat!
Hello Mrs. Pig.

54
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:26,400
Oink! May Peppa talk
with Suzy please?

55
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:28,280
Oink! Hello, Suzy!

56
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:30,359
Bleat! Hello, Peppa.

57
00:02:30,359 --> 00:02:34,480
I'm not very well.
I have red spots on my face.

58
00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:36,560
Has the doctor been?

59
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:38,400
Yes, Doctor Brown-Bear was here!

60
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:42,600
He said I was not very well
and that I was very brave.

61
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:44,560
So are you really ill?

62
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:47,079
Yes, yes!
It's not pretend!

63
00:02:47,079 --> 00:02:49,440
I have to stay in bed! Oink!

64
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:51,840
Doctor Brown-Bear
gave me medicine

65
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:54,160
that tasted
really horrible!

66
00:02:54,160 --> 00:02:56,880
I'm coming to see you! Bleat!

67
00:02:56,880 --> 00:03:00,000
I'm going to wear
my nurse's outfit!

68
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:03,200
Suzy Sheep
has come to see Peppa.

69
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:04,920
Suzy is wearing
her nurse's costume.

70
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:06,440
[LAUGHING]

71
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:10,320
Danny Dog and Rebecca Rabbit
have come along too.

72
00:03:12,399 --> 00:03:13,359
Hello Peppa!

73
00:03:13,359 --> 00:03:15,519
Oink! Hello!

74
00:03:15,519 --> 00:03:18,000
Bleat!
How do you feel?

75
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:20,519
I am not very well, Suzy.

76
00:03:20,519 --> 00:03:22,079
I have to stay in bed.

77
00:03:22,079 --> 00:03:24,519
What can we do
to make you better?

78
00:03:24,519 --> 00:03:27,880
Oink! You could get
me some orange juice.

79
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:29,079
Okay!

80
00:03:29,079 --> 00:03:30,440
[LAUGHTER]

81
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:33,399
Peppa seems to be
quite enjoying herself.

82
00:03:33,399 --> 00:03:34,840
[LAUGHS]

83
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,560
Thank you, Suzy.

84
00:03:37,679 --> 00:03:39,359
Do you feel any better?

85
00:03:39,359 --> 00:03:42,679
A little bit. Oink!
Danny?

86
00:03:42,679 --> 00:03:44,040
Woof!

87
00:03:44,040 --> 00:03:46,840
Ask my mummy if I could
have some ice cream.

88
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:51,440
And Rebecca, could you bring me
some flowers from the garden?

89
00:03:51,440 --> 00:03:54,920
Doctor Brown-Bear is here,
to see if Peppa is better.

90
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:57,799
Ah good, the nurse
is already here!

91
00:03:57,799 --> 00:03:59,399
How is the patient?

92
00:03:59,399 --> 00:04:04,119
Um, I'm not a real nurse,
it's just pretend.

93
00:04:04,119 --> 00:04:06,079
I see.

94
00:04:06,079 --> 00:04:08,280
Would you like me to
take a look myself?

95
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,640
Yes, please.

96
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:13,679
I say!
No more red spots!

97
00:04:13,679 --> 00:04:15,399
You're completely better!

98
00:04:15,399 --> 00:04:17,399
Aren't I still a bit ill?

99
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:18,800
How do you feel?

100
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:22,039
I think I should stay
in bed a little bit more.

101
00:04:22,039 --> 00:04:24,039
Hm. Oink!

102
00:04:24,039 --> 00:04:27,760
I fancy a game with
this ball, in the garden!!

103
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:29,080
Who wants to join me?

104
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:30,240
Me! Me! Me!

105
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,920
Me, too! Oink! Oink!

106
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,240
[LAUGHTER]

107
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:37,200
Well I never!
A complete recovery!

108
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:38,719
[LAUGHTER]

109
00:04:51,479 --> 00:04:55,520
[PEPPA READING
ONSCREEN TEXT]

110
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,800
Peppa and George
are very exited today.

111
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:03,039
It is snowing outside!

112
00:05:03,039 --> 00:05:06,039
Oink! Mummy! Can we go
and play in the snow?

113
00:05:06,039 --> 00:05:08,520
Oink! Yes.
But it's very cold outside,

114
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:09,640
so you must
wrap up warm.

115
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:10,719
Hurrah!
Oink!

116
00:05:10,719 --> 00:05:12,320
[LAUGHING]

117
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:16,280
And don't forget to wear your
hats, and scarves and gloves.

118
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:17,880
[LAUGHING]

119
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:19,320
It is very cold outside.

120
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:22,800
Peppa and George
must wear their hats,

121
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:25,760
and scarves,

122
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:27,800
and gloves.

123
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,000
[LAUGHING]

124
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,120
Oink!

125
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:31,560
Come on George! Oink!

126
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:33,120
[LAUGHING]

127
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:35,680
Peppa and George are making
footprints in the snow.

128
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:38,479
[OINKS,
THEN LAUGHS]

129
00:05:38,479 --> 00:05:41,919
Peppa and George love making
footprints in the snow!

130
00:05:41,919 --> 00:05:46,800
[LAUGHING]

131
00:05:47,919 --> 00:05:49,520
[YELPS]

132
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:52,280
Oh, dear.

133
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:55,080
[LAUGHS]

134
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:57,320
It's not funny.

135
00:05:58,599 --> 00:06:01,560
[LAUGHS,
THEN OINKS]

136
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:03,760
[LAUGHING]

137
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:05,080
Oink!

138
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:08,280
George, let's play snowballs!

139
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:14,359
Peppa has made a snowball.

140
00:06:17,359 --> 00:06:19,520
[LAUGHS,
THEN OINKS]

141
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:26,000
[LAUGHING]

142
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:28,840
Peppa and George
are having a lot of fun.

143
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:34,479
George, come back,
you little piggy

144
00:06:34,479 --> 00:06:37,760
[LAUGHING]

145
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:41,880
Oink! Oink!

146
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:43,719
Ah! Oink!

147
00:06:43,719 --> 00:06:46,200
[LAUGHING]

148
00:06:49,159 --> 00:06:52,240
Oink!

149
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:55,159
[WAILING]

150
00:06:55,159 --> 00:06:57,400
Oh, dear. Maybe this game

151
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:58,960
is getting a little too rough.

152
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,799
Oink!
Sorry, George.

153
00:07:00,799 --> 00:07:02,799
[SOBS]

154
00:07:02,799 --> 00:07:05,599
George!
Let's build a snowman!

155
00:07:05,599 --> 00:07:06,840
Oink!

156
00:07:06,840 --> 00:07:08,560
[LAUGHING]

157
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:10,880
Peppa and George
are making a snowman.

158
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:12,919
First they make the body.

159
00:07:12,919 --> 00:07:17,719
Oink! George, this
is the snowman's body.

160
00:07:17,719 --> 00:07:19,680
Now, they make
the snowman's head.

161
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:26,120
Oink! Now he needs some
arms and eyes and a mouth!

162
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:33,400
George has found some sticks
for the snowman's arms.

163
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:36,919
Peppa has found some stones for
the snowman's eyes and mouth.

164
00:07:38,039 --> 00:07:40,120
This is his face.

165
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:41,359
Oink!

166
00:07:41,359 --> 00:07:43,640
Now the snowman
needs a nose.

167
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:50,479
Peppa has got a carrot,
to make the snowman's nose.

168
00:07:50,479 --> 00:07:52,280
Oink! Oink!
Oink! Oink!

169
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:54,400
The snowman looks very happy.

170
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:56,960
But maybe he is bit cold.

171
00:07:56,960 --> 00:08:00,799
Oink! The snowman needs some
clothes, to keep him warm.

172
00:08:00,799 --> 00:08:02,280
[OINKS,
THEN LAUGHS]

173
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:07,560
George has found some clothes

174
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:09,840
to keep the snowman
nice and warm!

175
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:11,039
[LAUGHS,
THEN OINKS]

176
00:08:11,039 --> 00:08:12,359
[LAUGHING]

177
00:08:12,359 --> 00:08:14,760
The snowman
is wearing his hat,

178
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:18,479
and scarf,
and gloves.

179
00:08:18,479 --> 00:08:20,359
Mummy! Daddy!

180
00:08:20,359 --> 00:08:22,080
Oink! Come and look!

181
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:24,120
Oink! Oink!

182
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:27,760
Mummy is wearing her hat
and scarf and gloves.

183
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:32,760
Oink! That is the best
snowman I have ever seen!

184
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,360
[SHIVERING]

185
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:39,280
Daddy Pig looks quite cold.

186
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:42,559
He isn't wearing
his hat and scarf and gloves.

187
00:08:42,559 --> 00:08:44,360
[SNEEZES,
THEN OINKS]

188
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:49,800
Daddy, why aren't you wearing
your hat, and scarf and gloves?

189
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:52,199
I don't know where
they are! Oink!

190
00:08:52,199 --> 00:08:53,959
I can't find them anywhere!

191
00:08:53,959 --> 00:08:55,560
Oink! I think I know where

192
00:08:55,560 --> 00:08:58,640
Daddy's hat,
scarf and gloves are.

193
00:08:58,640 --> 00:09:02,160
Daddy Pig's hat and scarf
and gloves are on the Snowman!

194
00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:03,439
Oh!

195
00:09:03,439 --> 00:09:07,600
[LAUGHING]

196
00:09:09,319 --> 00:09:10,959
[LAUGHING]

197
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:21,880
[PEPPA READING
ONSCREEN TEXT]

198
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,360
[LAUGHING]

199
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:26,079
Peppa and her family
are going out for the day.

200
00:09:26,079 --> 00:09:28,160
Oink! Peppa, George.

201
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:30,520
Today we are going
to Windy Castle!

202
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:32,800
What's Windy Castle, Daddy?

203
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:35,040
It's a castle,
on a very high hill!

204
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:36,000
Oink! Oink!

205
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,640
George likes castles.

206
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:41,560
Oink! Windy Castle sounds
like a boring thing for boys.

207
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:44,000
No Peppa, you'll love it.

208
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:46,280
There's a great view from
the top of Windy Castle.

209
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:48,800
You can even see
Granny and Grandpa's house!

210
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:50,439
Wow! Let's go!

211
00:09:50,439 --> 00:09:51,680
[LAUGHING]

212
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:54,800
I'll map-read
and Mummy Pig will drive.

213
00:09:54,800 --> 00:09:56,400
MUMMY PIG:
Are you sure, Daddy Pig?

214
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:59,280
When you map-read we always
get lost and you get grumpy.

215
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:03,439
Oink! We will not get lost
and I will not get grumpy.

216
00:10:03,439 --> 00:10:06,040
[LAUGHING]

217
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:08,199
Windy Castle, here we come!

218
00:10:08,199 --> 00:10:09,360
[CAR HONKS]

219
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:14,600
Are we nearly
there yet?

220
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:16,199
Not quite.

221
00:10:16,199 --> 00:10:17,240
Oh.

222
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,800
Would you like to play a game?

223
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:20,360
Yes, please. Oink!

224
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:22,480
Let's play “I Spy!”

225
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,880
Okay.
I'll go first.

226
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:26,319
Daddy has to secretly
look at something

227
00:10:26,319 --> 00:10:28,680
and the others
guess what it is.

228
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:32,720
I spy with my little eye,
something colored red.

229
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:37,079
Red? Oink!
My dress! That's red!

230
00:10:37,079 --> 00:10:39,400
No. It's not
your dress.

231
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:40,880
Hmm.

232
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:42,000
The car!

233
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,640
That's right!
Our red car.

234
00:10:44,640 --> 00:10:45,640
[CAR HONKS]

235
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:46,640
[LAUGHTER]

236
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:48,040
My go.

237
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:51,640
I spy with my little eye,
something blue.

238
00:10:51,640 --> 00:10:54,000
DADDY PIG:
Hm, George's blue shirt!

239
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,079
Nope.

240
00:10:55,079 --> 00:10:57,600
Is it something in the car?

241
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:59,959
No. Give up?
Yes.

242
00:10:59,959 --> 00:11:02,719
The sky! The blue sky! Oink!

243
00:11:02,719 --> 00:11:03,719
I win.

244
00:11:03,719 --> 00:11:05,240
[LAUGHTER]

245
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:07,959
Daddy Pig?
Do you know where we are?

246
00:11:07,959 --> 00:11:09,920
I know exactly where we are.

247
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:11,400
Although...

248
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:14,959
This road doesn't look
the same as it does on the map.

249
00:11:14,959 --> 00:11:17,360
Oh, Daddy Pig! Oink!

250
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,680
We're lost!

251
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:20,240
We are not lost.

252
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:22,959
So how do we get
to Windy Castle from here?

253
00:11:22,959 --> 00:11:25,560
Just give me a moment.

254
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:26,800
Hm!

255
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:29,120
I know, we can
ring Granny and Grandpa.

256
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:32,079
There's no need to ring
Granny and Grandpa. Oink!

257
00:11:32,079 --> 00:11:34,760
I'll get us to Windy Castle,
if it takes me all day.

258
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:36,959
We haven't got all day.

259
00:11:38,319 --> 00:11:41,120
[PHONE RINGS]

260
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:44,280
Hello.
Grandpa Pig speaking.

261
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:48,839
Grandpa Pig, we've got a bit
lost on the way to Windy Castle.

262
00:11:48,839 --> 00:11:49,920
[LAUGHS]

263
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:52,520
Is Daddy Pig doing
the map-reading?

264
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:55,280
[LAUGHING]
Yes, Daddy Pig
is doing the map-reading.

265
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:57,400
And he's a bit grumpy
at the moment.

266
00:11:57,400 --> 00:11:59,480
I am not grumpy. Oink!

267
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:00,959
[LAUGHS]

268
00:12:00,959 --> 00:12:02,719
Oink!
This is the best route:

269
00:12:02,719 --> 00:12:08,160
keep on the main road until
you see Windy Castle up ahead.

270
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:10,079
Thank you Grandpa Pig.

271
00:12:10,079 --> 00:12:13,680
We follow the main road
and look out for Windy Castle.

272
00:12:13,680 --> 00:12:14,839
As I thought.

273
00:12:14,839 --> 00:12:16,439
[LAUGHTER]

274
00:12:16,439 --> 00:12:17,920
Look!

275
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:19,400
Is that a castle?

276
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:22,120
DADDY PIG:
Yes! It's Windy Castle!

277
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:23,560
[ENGINE STRAINING]

278
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:24,680
Come on car!

279
00:12:24,680 --> 00:12:28,560
Come on car!
You can make it!

280
00:12:29,439 --> 00:12:31,000
Hurray!

281
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:33,760
Peppa and her family have
arrived at Windy Castle.

282
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:36,000
Wow!
It's so tall!

283
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,839
Oink! Oink!
Let's go inside.

284
00:12:37,839 --> 00:12:40,560
The view from the top
is fantastic!

285
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:42,480
[CHILDREN LAUGHING]

286
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:46,439
CHILDREN:
Wow!

287
00:12:46,439 --> 00:12:48,560
MUMMY PIG:
Look at the view!

288
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:52,520
PEPPA:
Mummy, is that
Granny and Grandpa's house?

289
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:53,920
MUMMY PIG:
Yes, it is!

290
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:56,520
PEPPA:
It's so far away!

291
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:59,079
Let's take a look
through the telescope.

292
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:02,680
Can I look
first, please?

293
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:05,480
Yes, but you must
let George look next.

294
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,880
Wow!

295
00:13:06,880 --> 00:13:09,319
The telescope makes
everything look bigger.

296
00:13:09,319 --> 00:13:12,640
PEPPA:
I can see Granny and Grandpa!

297
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:13,680
Look George!

298
00:13:13,680 --> 00:13:15,760
Oink!

299
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:18,439
GEORGE:
Gangy 'ig!
Baba 'ig!

300
00:13:18,439 --> 00:13:21,400
George is waving
at Granny and Grandpa Pig.

301
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:23,280
Silly George! Oink!

302
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:27,319
Granny and Grandpa are too
far away to see you waving!

303
00:13:27,319 --> 00:13:29,520
I know!
We can ring them!

304
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:32,599
[PHONE RINGING]

305
00:13:32,599 --> 00:13:33,520
Hello?

306
00:13:33,520 --> 00:13:35,240
MUMMY PIG:
Grandpa Pig! We can see you

307
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:38,120
from Windy Castle!
Wave at us!

308
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:41,240
GEORGE:
Granny and Grandpa
are waving at us!

309
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,280
[LAUGHING]

310
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:45,439
I love Windy Castle!

311
00:13:51,280 --> 00:13:53,199
[PEPPA READING
ONSCREEN TEXT]

312
00:13:53,199 --> 00:13:54,839
[CHILDREN LAUGHING]

313
00:13:54,839 --> 00:13:58,199
Peppa and George
are playing in the garden.

314
00:13:58,199 --> 00:14:00,800
Too me, George.

315
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:03,400
You threw the ball
too hard George!

316
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:05,920
So the rules say
I win! Oink!

317
00:14:05,920 --> 00:14:08,400
Now it's my turn.

318
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:10,520
[LAUGHS,
THEN OINKS]

319
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:11,560
I win again!
Oink!

320
00:14:11,560 --> 00:14:13,000
Peppa, George.

321
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:15,640
Today your big cousin,
Chloé is coming to visit!

322
00:14:15,640 --> 00:14:17,400
Yippee! Cousin Chloé!

323
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:18,599
Oink! Oink!

324
00:14:18,599 --> 00:14:21,520
George, Chloé
is a big girl, like me.

325
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:26,360
So, don't be sad if she finds
you too little to play with.

326
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:29,560
I'm sure Chloé will
play with both of you.

327
00:14:29,560 --> 00:14:30,599
[CAR HONKS]

328
00:14:30,599 --> 00:14:32,240
Chloé's here! Oink!

329
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:34,040
Aunty Pig has brought Chloé

330
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:35,920
to spend the day
at Peppa's house.

331
00:14:35,920 --> 00:14:38,599
Chloé is Peppa and George's
cousin.

332
00:14:38,599 --> 00:14:41,079
Chloé is a bit older
than Peppa and George.

333
00:14:41,079 --> 00:14:43,120
Oink! Hello Chloé!
Oink! Oink!

334
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:45,400
Hello Peppa! Hello George!
Oink!

335
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:47,760
[LAUGHING]
See you later!

336
00:14:47,760 --> 00:14:49,360
Do you want to play a game?

337
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:51,400
Oink! Yes!
Let's play "Catch!"

338
00:14:51,400 --> 00:14:53,640
Peppa loves playing "Catch".

339
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:55,160
Do you still
play "Catch"?

340
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:57,280
That's a game
for little children.

341
00:14:57,280 --> 00:15:02,040
Oh. We only play "Catch"
because George likes it.

342
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:04,439
Okay. Let's play
it for George.

343
00:15:04,439 --> 00:15:08,120
Do you play with proper rules
or the baby rules?

344
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:09,560
Proper rules!

345
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:12,479
I'll start. Oink!
Peppa, you're "it".

346
00:15:12,479 --> 00:15:14,400
Catch me if you can!

347
00:15:14,400 --> 00:15:15,400
Oink!

348
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:16,640
Peppa is "it".

349
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:18,760
She has to chase
Chloé and George.

350
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:21,160
[LAUGHING]
Can't catch me!

351
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:23,760
George!
I'm going to easily catch you!

352
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:25,199
You're so little!

353
00:15:25,199 --> 00:15:26,280
[LAUGHING]

354
00:15:26,280 --> 00:15:28,319
Oink! That's not fair!

355
00:15:28,319 --> 00:15:30,000
You're helping George!

356
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:31,800
That's because he's little.

357
00:15:31,800 --> 00:15:33,719
Oink!
Do you want me to help you?

358
00:15:33,719 --> 00:15:35,479
No! I don't need help.

359
00:15:35,479 --> 00:15:37,240
I'm a big girl like you.

360
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:39,880
Come on then, Peppa!
Try and catch us!

361
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:40,920
[LAUGHING]

362
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:42,439
Can't catch us!

363
00:15:42,439 --> 00:15:44,479
[PANTING]

364
00:15:44,479 --> 00:15:46,199
Can't catch us!

365
00:15:46,199 --> 00:15:47,680
This is a silly game.

366
00:15:47,680 --> 00:15:49,280
Can we play something else?

367
00:15:49,280 --> 00:15:53,199
Okay, I know a really good game,
for big children.

368
00:15:53,199 --> 00:15:55,560
It's called "Sly Fox"!
Oink!

369
00:15:55,560 --> 00:15:59,479
"Sly Fox"?
I want to play "Sly Fox"!

370
00:15:59,479 --> 00:16:01,560
What is it?

371
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:05,199
One person is the “Sly Fox”.
Oink!

372
00:16:05,199 --> 00:16:07,079
And the others
creep up on them.

373
00:16:07,079 --> 00:16:08,240
Oink! Me! Me!

374
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:10,240
I want to be the “Sly Fox”!

375
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:12,040
Peppa is the "Sly Fox".

376
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:15,079
While her back is turned,
the others creep up on her.

377
00:16:15,079 --> 00:16:17,880
But if Peppa turns
and sees someone move,

378
00:16:17,880 --> 00:16:20,599
they have to go
back to the start!

379
00:16:20,599 --> 00:16:23,560
George! I saw you move!
Back to the start!

380
00:16:23,560 --> 00:16:25,520
[LAUGHS]

381
00:16:25,520 --> 00:16:27,839
Got you! I win!

382
00:16:27,839 --> 00:16:30,120
You moved before
I was ready!

383
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:32,120
The rules say
I can move when I like.

384
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,319
Don't they George?

385
00:16:33,319 --> 00:16:34,640
Oink! Oink!

386
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:37,959
Now it's Chloé's
turn to be the sly fox.

387
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:43,400
Peppa and George
must stay very still.

388
00:16:45,160 --> 00:16:46,439
[YELPS]

389
00:16:46,439 --> 00:16:47,959
Peppa!
I saw you move!

390
00:16:47,959 --> 00:16:49,240
Back to the start!

391
00:16:49,240 --> 00:16:52,520
Oink! It's not fair!
You looked too long!

392
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:55,599
The rules say,
I can look as long as I want.

393
00:16:55,599 --> 00:16:57,280
Oink! Back to the start.

394
00:16:58,319 --> 00:16:59,680
[LAUGHS,
THEN OINKS]

395
00:16:59,680 --> 00:17:01,040
George is the winner!

396
00:17:01,040 --> 00:17:02,479
[LAUGHING]

397
00:17:02,479 --> 00:17:04,159
Can we play
a different game?

398
00:17:04,159 --> 00:17:07,240
Yes. Oink! But as long
as it's a grown-up game.

399
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:10,639
I know! Oink!
Let's play my favorite game!

400
00:17:10,639 --> 00:17:13,119
It's very grown-up!

401
00:17:13,119 --> 00:17:16,200
George, do you know what
Peppa's favorite game is?

402
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:17,240
Oink! Oink!

403
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:18,720
Peppa's favorite game

404
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:20,839
is jumping up and down
in muddy puddles!

405
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:24,280
George, if you jump in puddles,
you must wear your boots!

406
00:17:24,280 --> 00:17:25,560
Oink!

407
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:29,399
I've brought some boots
for you too, Chloé!

408
00:17:29,399 --> 00:17:32,760
I'm too grown-up to
jump in muddy puddles.

409
00:17:32,760 --> 00:17:35,280
Oh. So am I.

410
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:36,520
[LAUGHING]

411
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:39,600
George loves
jumping in muddy puddles

412
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:42,399
Secretly, Peppa would
love to jump in the puddle.

413
00:17:42,399 --> 00:17:44,360
But she wants
to look grown-up.

414
00:17:44,360 --> 00:17:47,639
I hear there's some
puddle jumping going on!

415
00:17:47,639 --> 00:17:51,879
Mummy and Daddy Pig
love jumping in muddy puddles!

416
00:17:51,879 --> 00:17:53,800
It does look fun.

417
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:56,280
Yes, it does.

418
00:17:56,280 --> 00:17:58,200
[LAUGHING]

419
00:17:58,200 --> 00:17:59,440
Maybe there's
a rule that says,

420
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:02,280
big girls can jump
in muddy puddles.

421
00:18:02,280 --> 00:18:04,360
Yes!
That's a good rule! Oink!

422
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:06,919
Race you!

423
00:18:06,919 --> 00:18:08,520
Race you!

424
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:12,159
Peppa and Chloé love
jumping in muddy puddles!

425
00:18:12,159 --> 00:18:15,200
Everyone loves jumping
up and down in muddy puddles,

426
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:17,680
even grown-up girls!

427
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:18,960
[LAUGHING]

428
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:21,080
[♪♪♪]

429
00:18:21,080 --> 00:18:22,200
[GIGGLING]

430
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:23,879
PEPPA:
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

431
00:18:23,879 --> 00:18:26,840
[SNORTING, GIGGLING]

432
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:28,720
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

433
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:31,080
[SNORTING, GIGGLING]

434
00:18:31,080 --> 00:18:32,919
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

435
00:18:32,919 --> 00:18:34,720
[GRUNTING]

